### Media3
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "description": "Sci-fi thriller",
  "mediaType": "movie",
  "releaseYear": 2010,
  "genres": [
    "sci-fi",
    "thriller"
  ],
