### List All
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media?title=incep&genre=sci-fi&sortBy=score
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/media/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception Updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "mediaType": "movie",
  "releaseYear": 2010,
  "genres": [
    "sci-fi",
    "action"
  ],
  "ageRestriction": 16
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/media/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Check Medias
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media?title=incep&genre=sci-fi&sortBy=score
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}